===Strategy===

Easy kill with any ranged weapon from ground, they can't reach you.

Carefull for their [[Tail Splash]] attack, it creates large blue openings and can be used up to five tiles away.

==In-Game Example(s)==
[[File:{{PAGENAME}}-dead.png|150px]] Dead {{PAGENAME}}. Can be scaled for [[Fresh {{PAGENAME}} Scales]].<br>
[[File:{{PAGENAME}}-skinned.png|150px]] Scaled {{PAGENAME}}. Can be butchered for [[Intestines]], [[Entrails]], [[Cave Angler Light]], [[Fishy Eyeball]] and [[Filet of Cave Angler]].<br>
[[File:{{PAGENAME}}-skeleton.png|150px]] {{PAGENAME}} Skeleton. Can be collected for [[Bone Material]].<br>

==Notes==

*[[Lamp Stalk]]s rarely reveal themselves to be [[Cave Angler]]s (even in shallow water).
*Cave Anglers move faster than a [[Rowboat]].
*Can't leave water terrain.
*Not affected by any [[Credos]].

